--- !u!114 &1921403243
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1921403240}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1b5260f7b0f7473f97182078f068a719, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: CryoController::CryoController.Readable
  title: Welcome to the playground
  text: 'Everything here runs on CryoController''s own components, set up in the
    Inspector.


    Move, look, jump and sprint; crouch to duck under the low roof,
    and crouch while sprinting to power slide. Lean round corners. Escape or Start
    pauses: Options has sensitivity, field of view and comfort settings, and Controls
    shows and changes every binding.

    ---

    Walk into the low ledges to climb
    them, and jump at the high ones. Walk into a ladder to climb it; the tall tower''s
    ladder leads to a drop that shows fall damage.


    Carry the boxes, inspect
    them, and throw them; the crate only gets pushed. The lever opens the gate, and
    the detonator shakes the camera.

    ---

    The shed to the east is locked.
    Its key is somewhere close.


    The pool to the south-west is 2 m deep: climb
    the stairs to its deck and jump in. Crouch dives, Jump rises, and swimming into
    the deck climbs out.

    ---

    L, or down on the D-pad, switches the flashlight
    on and off; try it in the shed.


    Pause and choose Save, change something,
    then Load: the doors, keys, boxes, lever and you go back to how they were.


    1
    and 2, or left and right on the D-pad, switch between the movement profiles:
    the controller''s own settings, Realistic, Arcade and Tactical.'
  prompt: Read
  onRead:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
